{
  "api": {
    "title": "CampusMate 定时任务管理 API",
    "version": "1.9.0",
    "basePath": "/mate-service/v1",
    "visibility": "Public · 待评审 · 待实现"
  },
  "operation": {
    "method": "POST",
    "path": "/schedules",
    "summary": "创建定时任务",
    "description": "当前用户在页面上配置一个定时任务，例如“工作日 08:00 汇总园区设备告警”。Mate 检查配额后把请求体与用户的 access-token 转发给 Claw，Claw 用 token 查出创建者；创建成功后 Mate 记录任务归属，返回把 sessionId 换成 chatId 的完整任务。创建不立即运行，也不创建 Chat。本接口不定义请求头，前端调用时 Mate 框架已完成 access-token 校验。",
    "parameters": [],
    "requestBody": {
      "required": true,
      "contentType": "application/json",
      "description": "字段与 Claw 创建接口相同，Mate 原样转发、不增删。name 必填，去首尾空白后 1..256 个字符，可重名；description 可选，最多 2048 个字符；agentId 必填，只校验格式，不校验 Agent 是否存在或启用；prompt 必填，去首尾空白后非空的纯文本，每次运行作为新会话的首条用户消息；schedule 可选，省略或 null 表示只手动运行，非空时只接受 type=cron、Spring 六字段 expression 和可选 IANA timezone（默认 Asia/Shanghai）；metadata 可选，最多 16 对字符串，键最多 64、值最多 512 个字符。不得传入 chatId、sessionId、userId 或 type、id、status、pausedReason、createdAt、updatedAt、lastRunAt、upcomingRunsAt 等只读字段，未知字段同样拒绝。",
      "example": {
        "name": "工作日园区告警汇总",
        "agentId": "agent-550e8400e29b41d4a716446655440000",
        "prompt": "汇总园区过去24小时的设备告警，并标出需要跟进的工单。",
        "schedule": {
          "type": "cron",
          "expression": "0 0 8 * * MON-FRI",
          "timezone": "Asia/Shanghai"
        },
        "metadata": {
          "parkCode": "park-east",
          "purpose": "alarm-summary"
        }
      }
    },
    "responses": [
      {
        "id": "201-created",
        "status": "201",
        "tabLabel": "201 · 已创建",
        "label": "Created",
        "summary": "返回完整任务；Location 指向 Mate 的详情路径。接口创建的任务 chatId 恒为 null，每次运行时才新建 Chat。示例分别是按工作日自动运行和只手动运行的任务。",
        "headers": {
          "Content-Type": "application/json",
          "Cache-Control": "no-store",
          "Location": "/mate-service/v1/schedules/schedule-927e03d2a4784f90a6238e790539c6e4"
        },
        "bodies": {
          "工作日 08:00 自动运行": {
            "resCode": "0",
            "resMsg": "success",
            "result": {
              "type": "schedule",
              "id": "schedule-927e03d2a4784f90a6238e790539c6e4",
              "name": "工作日园区告警汇总",
              "description": null,
              "agentId": "agent-550e8400e29b41d4a716446655440000",
              "chatId": null,
              "prompt": "汇总园区过去24小时的设备告警，并标出需要跟进的工单。",
              "schedule": {
                "type": "cron",
                "expression": "0 0 8 * * MON-FRI",
                "timezone": "Asia/Shanghai",
                "lastRunAt": null,
                "upcomingRunsAt": [
                  "2026-10-05T00:00:00Z",
                  "2026-10-06T00:00:00Z",
                  "2026-10-07T00:00:00Z",
                  "2026-10-08T00:00:00Z",
                  "2026-10-09T00:00:00Z"
                ]
              },
              "status": "active",
              "pausedReason": null,
              "createdAt": "2026-10-04T02:00:00Z",
              "updatedAt": "2026-10-04T02:00:00Z",
              "metadata": {
                "parkCode": "park-east",
                "purpose": "alarm-summary"
              }
            }
          },
          "只手动运行（schedule 为 null）": {
            "resCode": "0",
            "resMsg": "success",
            "result": {
              "type": "schedule",
              "id": "schedule-3c5e7a9b1d2f4e6a8b0c2d4e6f8a0b1c",
              "name": "园区告警汇总（手动运行）",
              "description": null,
              "agentId": "agent-550e8400e29b41d4a716446655440000",
              "chatId": null,
              "prompt": "汇总园区过去24小时的设备告警，并标出需要跟进的工单。",
              "schedule": null,
              "status": "active",
              "pausedReason": null,
              "createdAt": "2026-10-04T02:05:00Z",
              "updatedAt": "2026-10-04T02:05:00Z",
              "metadata": {
                "parkCode": "park-east",
                "purpose": "alarm-summary"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "400-schedule-name-invalid",
        "status": "400",
        "tabLabel": "400 · SCHEDULE_NAME_INVALID",
        "label": "Bad Request",
        "summary": "name 缺失、去空白后为空或超过 256 个字符。Claw 校验，Mate 原样返回错误码并按语言给出文案。",
        "headers": {
          "Content-Type": "application/json",
          "Cache-Control": "no-store",
          "Content-Language": "zh-CN"
        },
        "bodies": {
          "zh-CN": {
            "resCode": "SCHEDULE_NAME_INVALID",
            "resMsg": "定时任务名称无效。"
          },
          "en-US": {
            "resCode": "SCHEDULE_NAME_INVALID",
            "resMsg": "Invalid schedule name."
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "400-schedule-prompt-invalid",
        "status": "400",
        "tabLabel": "400 · SCHEDULE_PROMPT_INVALID",
        "label": "Bad Request",
        "summary": "prompt 缺失或去空白后为空。",
        "headers": {
          "Content-Type": "application/json",
          "Cache-Control": "no-store",
          "Content-Language": "zh-CN"
        },
        "bodies": {
          "zh-CN": {
            "resCode": "SCHEDULE_PROMPT_INVALID",
            "resMsg": "定时任务内容无效。"
          },
          "en-US": {
            "resCode": "SCHEDULE_PROMPT_INVALID",
            "resMsg": "Invalid schedule prompt."
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "400-schedule-rule-invalid",
        "status": "400",
        "tabLabel": "400 · SCHEDULE_RULE_INVALID",
        "label": "Bad Request",
        "summary": "schedule 不是 cron 对象，或 expression 不是合法的 Spring 六字段表达式。",
        "headers": {
          "Content-Type": "application/json",
          "Cache-Control": "no-store",
          "Content-Language": "zh-CN"
        },
        "bodies": {
          "zh-CN": {
            "resCode": "SCHEDULE_RULE_INVALID",
            "resMsg": "定时规则无效，请使用合法的 Spring 六字段 Cron 表达式。"
          },
          "en-US": {
            "resCode": "SCHEDULE_RULE_INVALID",
            "resMsg": "Invalid schedule rule. Use a valid Spring six-field Cron expression."
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "400-schedule-timezone-invalid",
        "status": "400",
        "tabLabel": "400 · SCHEDULE_TIMEZONE_INVALID",
        "label": "Bad Request",
        "summary": "timezone 不是有效的 IANA 时区名称。",
        "headers": {
          "Content-Type": "application/json",
          "Cache-Control": "no-store",
          "Content-Language": "zh-CN"
        },
        "bodies": {
          "zh-CN": {
            "resCode": "SCHEDULE_TIMEZONE_INVALID",
            "resMsg": "定时时区无效。"
          },
          "en-US": {
            "resCode": "SCHEDULE_TIMEZONE_INVALID",
            "resMsg": "Invalid schedule timezone."
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "400-schedule-request-invalid",
        "status": "400",
        "tabLabel": "400 · SCHEDULE_REQUEST_INVALID",
        "label": "Bad Request",
        "summary": "JSON 非法；description、agentId 或 metadata 不符合约束；传入了 chatId、sessionId、只读字段或未知字段。",
        "headers": {
          "Content-Type": "application/json",
          "Cache-Control": "no-store",
          "Content-Language": "zh-CN"
        },
        "bodies": {
          "zh-CN": {
            "resCode": "SCHEDULE_REQUEST_INVALID",
            "resMsg": "定时任务请求无效。"
          },
          "en-US": {
            "resCode": "SCHEDULE_REQUEST_INVALID",
            "resMsg": "Invalid schedule request."
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "422-schedule-quota-exceeded",
        "status": "422",
        "tabLabel": "422 · SCHEDULE_QUOTA_EXCEEDED",
        "label": "Unprocessable Content",
        "summary": "当前用户通过接口创建的任务数已达上限（默认 20，部署可配置），Mate 在转发前判断，没有调用 Claw。",
        "headers": {
          "Content-Type": "application/json",
          "Cache-Control": "no-store",
          "Content-Language": "zh-CN"
        },
        "bodies": {
          "zh-CN": {
            "resCode": "SCHEDULE_QUOTA_EXCEEDED",
            "resMsg": "定时任务数量已达上限，请删除不再需要的任务后再创建。"
          },
          "en-US": {
            "resCode": "SCHEDULE_QUOTA_EXCEEDED",
            "resMsg": "You have reached the maximum number of schedules. Delete schedules you no longer need and try again."
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "422-schedule-policy-rejected",
        "status": "422",
        "tabLabel": "422 · SCHEDULE_POLICY_REJECTED",
        "label": "Unprocessable Content",
        "summary": "Cron 规则超出部署的频率策略，由 Claw 判断。",
        "headers": {
          "Content-Type": "application/json",
          "Cache-Control": "no-store",
          "Content-Language": "zh-CN"
        },
        "bodies": {
          "zh-CN": {
            "resCode": "SCHEDULE_POLICY_REJECTED",
            "resMsg": "定时任务超出部署策略。"
          },
          "en-US": {
            "resCode": "SCHEDULE_POLICY_REJECTED",
            "resMsg": "The schedule exceeds the deployment policy."
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "500-schedule-create-failed",
        "status": "500",
        "tabLabel": "500 · SCHEDULE_CREATE_FAILED",
        "label": "Internal Server Error",
        "summary": "Claw 内部处理失败，任务没有创建。Mate 自己写归属记录失败时与其他接口一样返回 Mate 通用 500，残留在 Claw 的任务对用户不可见，由对账清理。",
        "headers": {
          "Content-Type": "application/json",
          "Cache-Control": "no-store",
          "Content-Language": "zh-CN"
        },
        "bodies": {
          "zh-CN": {
            "resCode": "SCHEDULE_CREATE_FAILED",
            "resMsg": "创建定时任务失败。"
          },
          "en-US": {
            "resCode": "SCHEDULE_CREATE_FAILED",
            "resMsg": "Failed to create the schedule."
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "503-schedule-service-unavailable",
        "status": "503",
        "tabLabel": "503 · SCHEDULE_SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE",
        "label": "Service Unavailable",
        "summary": "Claw 不可达、证书校验失败，或请求已发出但结果未知（超时、断连）。Mate 不自动重试，也不返回 Retry-After；用户刷新列表确认后再决定是否重新创建。",
        "headers": {
          "Content-Type": "application/json",
          "Cache-Control": "no-store",
          "Content-Language": "zh-CN"
        },
        "bodies": {
          "zh-CN": {
            "resCode": "SCHEDULE_SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE",
            "resMsg": "定时任务服务暂不可用，请刷新列表确认任务是否已创建后再试。"
          },
          "en-US": {
            "resCode": "SCHEDULE_SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE",
            "resMsg": "The schedule service is temporarily unavailable. Refresh the list to check whether the schedule was created before trying again."
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "review": {
    "questions": [],
    "followUpTitle": "创建接口待评审",
    "promptPrefix": "更新 POST /mate-service/v1/schedules",
    "promptSuffix": "保持与 CampusMate 定时任务设计 §4.2 和 Claw 创建接口同步。"
  }
}
